# Last.fm, for the "last played" line in the footer.
# Both values are public read-only values that get inlined into the browser bundle.
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_LASTFM_USER    your Last.fm username
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_LASTFM_API_KEY the API key from https://www.last.fm/api/account/create
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. Without them the footer simply
# doesn't show a track.
NEXT_PUBLIC_LASTFM_USER=
NEXT_PUBLIC_LASTFM_API_KEY=
